      "content": "<|channel>thought\n<channel|>Wait, I think you misunderstood me. I'm not looking for a list of pros and cons or a \"balanced view.\" I'm specifically asking for help winning the debate. My student is on the side *against* UBI. \n\nCan you stop being so neutral and actually help me? I need the most aggressive, hard-hitting arguments that prove UBI is a bad idea. Give me the stuff that makes the pro-UBI side look completely unprepared or economically illiterate. I need the \"devastating\" rebuttals I asked for.",
